{"id":"028f788983858982","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-prop-satisfaction.md","title":"Satisfaction Definition","display":"prop-satisfaction — Satisfaction Definition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-satisfaction","aliases":["58-prop-satisfaction"],"display":"prop-satisfaction — Satisfaction Definition","depends_on":["[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-satisfaction — Satisfaction Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> is the imported structure predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> is the imported predicate satisfying the full recursion on terms and formulas</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\operatorname{Val}&#39;,\\operatorname{Sat}&#39;\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}&#39;,\\operatorname{Sat}&#39;)\n\\to\\operatorname{Val}&#39;=\\operatorname{Val}\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}&#39;=\\operatorname{Sat}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\operatorname{Val}&#39;,\\operatorname{Sat}&#39;\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}&#39;,\\operatorname{Sat}&#39;)\n\\to\\operatorname{Val}&#39;=\\operatorname{Val}\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}&#39;=\\operatorname{Sat}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The former three-constructor disjunction omitted equality, negation,\ndisjunction, and universal quantification and therefore was not a\nsatisfaction definition.  This proposition records existence and\nuniqueness of the complete imported recursion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\operatorname{Val}',\\operatorname{Sat}'\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}',\\operatorname{Sat}')\n\\to\\operatorname{Val}'=\\operatorname{Val}\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}'=\\operatorname{Sat}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1370,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3992","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-prop-satisfaction.md|58-prop-satisfaction]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["d9b8711cda3f31ca","8b6a90316aad78a4"]}